cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use R2PG-DM, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "R2PG-DM: Relational to Property Graph Direct Mapping"
abstract: "R2PG-DM is an open-source Java tool that constructs property graphs from relational databases via a direct mapping. It supports Microsoft SQL Server, MySQL, PostgreSQL, and SQLite source databases; produces nodes/edges/properties CSVs, a combined JSON for AvantGraph import, and a PG-Schema graph schema; identifies join tables and maps them to edges with properties; and supports progressive execution for enterprise-scale datasets."
